Cell[TextData[{
 "State how well the non-linear model performed (explaining your reasoning) \
and compare it to the linear model.\n",
 StyleBox["Answer:",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8406077677898483`*^9, 3.8406077805787115`*^9}, {
   3.840607817148863*^9, 3.8406078233314943`*^9}, {3.840610140231086*^9, 
   3.8406101687976065`*^9}, {3.8406102722419147`*^9, 3.840610312311409*^9}, {
   3.840610488985128*^9, 3.840610492835432*^9}, {3.8406115632144876`*^9, 
   3.840611566794153*^9}, {3.8406117273500357`*^9, 3.840611735133881*^9}, {
   3.840619975800766*^9, 3.8406199830796323`*^9}, {3.840620082988729*^9, 
   3.84062008898042*^9}, {3.8406216718281384`*^9, 3.8406217115710506`*^9}, {
   3.8406217827952547`*^9, 3.8406217834132743`*^9}, {3.840623666882721*^9, 
   3.8406236672154307`*^9}, 3.840623703349069*^9, {3.9681341681695957`*^9, 
   3.9681341956673574`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bbd39193-8b8d-46a4-b448-\
cf6bbac66c47"],

Cell["\<\
The linear regression model performed better than the non-linear regression \
model based on the results.

The linear model had an MSE of 1.89 \[Times] 10\:2079, RMSE of 43,508.50 and \
R Squared of 0.71769. This means it explained approximately 71.77% of the \
variation in house prices.

The non-linear model performed poorly compared to the linear model. It had a \
higher MSE of 8.12 \[Times] 10\:2079, RMSE of 90,092.50 and a negative R \
Squared of -0.210471. This means the non-linear model performed worse than \
predicting the average house price.

The non-linear model used 71 parameters compared to the linear model\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s 36, but adding more features did not improve the \
predictions. This could be due to overfitting or the Gradient Descent \
algorithm not finding suitable parameters.

Overall, the linear regression model was more accurate and would be the \
better choice based on these results.

\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8406077657661633`*^9, 3.8406077988842287`*^9}, {
   3.8406214832776375`*^9, 3.840621485297165*^9}, {4.004198920020817*^9, 
   4.0041989257308426`*^9}, {4.00419916369261*^9, 4.0041992196031437`*^9}, 
   4.004441667328342*^9, 
   4.0044519950766797`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a353913f-d856-40c0-a522-\
51f0838fc1de"],

Cell["Code used to produce answer:", "Text",
